  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_DAWN_KNIGHTS": "Founding of the Dawn Knights",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_DAWN_KNIGHTS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once: the Knights of the Dawn are born as your vassal, of the Order, +4 attitude toward good civilizations.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Two cities on free sites within 6 plots of your borders; the first has a Wall of Stone and a Temple of the Order.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]They start with four Dawn Knights and the Grand Master, a hero (HP 160, attack 170, defence 150).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Their Dawn Knights cost 120 hammers (a Paladin 240) and have no limit per player.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Their units heal fully after each battle they win against units of evil civilizations.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Needs a free player slot.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_DAWN_KNIGHTS_PEDIA": "An order of knights sworn at first light, to stand where the dark comes in.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Expert: found them on the border you share with an evil neighbour; every battle they win against it heals them.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_DAWN_KNIGHTS": "Founding of the Dawn Knights",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_DAWN_KNIGHTS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]The Knights of the Dawn are born as your vassal, in two cities within 6 plots of your borders.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]They start with four Dawn Knights and the Grand Master.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Once per game. Needs a free player slot.",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_PALACE_DAWN_KNIGHTS": "Palace",
    "TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_DAWN_VOW": "Dawn Vow",
    "TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_DAWN_VOW_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Heals fully after each battle won against units of evil civilizations.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_DAWN_KNIGHT": "Dawn Knight",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_DAWN_KNIGHT_PEDIA": "A knight of the Dawn: armoured, mounted and sworn.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_DAWN_KNIGHT_STRATEGY": "The Knights of the Dawn's own tier-4 unit, at half a Paladin's cost.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_GRAND_MASTER": "Grand Master",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_GRAND_MASTER_PEDIA": "The Grand Master of the Dawn has held the order's banner through a hundred winters.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_GRAND_MASTER_STRATEGY": "A hero far above a Paladin: lead the knights against the evil civilizations.",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_DAWN_KNIGHTS_DESC": "Knights of the Dawn",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_DAWN_KNIGHTS_SHORT_DESC": "The Dawn",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_DAWN_KNIGHTS_ADJECTIVE": "Dawn",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_DAWN_KNIGHTS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Its own Dawn Knight (tier 4, 120 hammers, no limit per player).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Its units heal fully after each battle they win against units of evil civilizations.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]+4 attitude toward good civilizations.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Hero: the Grand Master.",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_DAWN_KNIGHTS_PEDIA": "The Knights of the Dawn are an order of holy knights. They keep fortress cities on the borders of the faithful and ride out against the servants of the dark.",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_DAWN_KNIGHTS_1": "Dawnhold",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_DAWN_KNIGHTS_2": "Lightspire",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_DAWN_KNIGHTS_3": "Vigil",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_DAWN_KNIGHTS_4": "Sunward",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_DAWN_KNIGHTS_5": "Morrow Keep",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_DAWN_KNIGHTS_6": "Oathgate",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_DAWN_KNIGHTS_7": "Brightwater",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_DAWN_KNIGHTS_8": "Halcyon",
    "TXT_KEY_LEADER_HALRIC": "Halric",
    "TXT_KEY_LEADER_HALRIC_PEDIA": "Seneschal Halric keeps the order's fortresses and its accounts. The Grand Master leads the charge; Halric makes sure there are horses for it."
  }
}
